stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> unopened
    unopened --> drafting: user opens private reflection
    drafting --> saved_session: user saves in session memory
    drafting --> saved_local: user chooses encrypted local storage
    drafting --> exported: user explicitly exports a file
    drafting --> discarded: user discards draft
    saved_session --> discarded: tab closes or user deletes
    saved_local --> expired: user-selected expiry occurs
    saved_local --> deleted: user deletes
    saved_local --> exported: user explicitly exports
    exported --> discarded: local copy absent or user deletes it
    discarded --> [*]
    deleted --> [*]
    expired --> [*]
